specs/hal-engine-abandon-on-close/spec.md:22:- A message queued behind the turn, or handed over after the close, is dropped: nothing is recorded, the orchestrator is never asked and nothing is sent ([validated by: drops a turn whose connection signal is already aborted: records nothing, asks nothing, sends nothing](../../src/transport/ws/messageHandler.test.ts#L895)).
