specs/hal-engine-conversation-list/spec.md:71:- A store that cannot implement listing signals `UNSUPPORTED`, so a configured but incapable store is not reported as a transient server failure ([validated by: answers an unsupported conversation list with UNSUPPORTED](../../src/transport/ws/messageHandler.test.ts#L199)).
